# Frontend UI Rules

## Component Standards
- Build shared primitives in `src/components/ui`.
- Keep feature-specific widgets inside `src/features/<feature>/components`.
- Prefer composition over deep prop drilling.

## State and Accessibility
- Every interactive element must provide visible focus styles.
- Support keyboard interaction and semantic attributes.
- Meet minimum target size for touch interactions (44x44).

## Styling Discipline
- Use design tokens via CSS variables.
- Keep utility classes readable and intention-revealing.
- Do not duplicate style recipes across components.

## Route Layer Discipline
- Keep `app/*/page.tsx` focused on composition only.
- Move data and behavior logic to feature/services layers.
